cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper given under preferred-citation."
title: "LaneBPSW"
abstract: >-
  A single-threaded research implementation of lane-packed Baillie–PSW testing with AVX-512 IFMA. It is designed
  for output compatibility with mpz_millerrabin(n, 25) and mpz_nextprime of GMP 6.3.0 and with the documented
  chiavdf 1.2.x predicates in their stated domains. The supplied tests found no mismatches; equivalence is not
  formally proved, and performance results are specific to the documented systems and workloads.
authors:
